mber\00Mar\00Sep\00%I:%M:%S %p\00Sun\00Jun\00Corn\004 in 1 deal, now with a secret ingredient: poison\00Dandelion\00Mon\00Twin\00Pollen\00nan\00Jan\00/dev/urandom\00Jul\00ll\00April\004 in 1 deal\00local\00Very poisonous, but takes a little while to do its work\00Rock\00A nice petal, not too strong but not too weak\00Fri\00Not very strong, but somehow increases your maximum health\00Takes a long time to spawn, but has a lot of health\00Its healing properties are amazing. Not so good at combat though\00March\00Massive Ladybug\00Aug\00Spawns instantly, but not very strong\00Wing\00Yin Yang\00Egg\00Extremely powerful rose, almost unheard of\00inf\00Does not stack with itself\00Leaf\00%.0Lf\00%Lf\00true\00Tue\00Rose\00false\00Asthmatics beware\00Square\00June\00None\00You can actually shoot this one\00Massive Beetle\00Ant Hole\00Missile\00It really hurts, but it's very fragile\00Bubble\00Extremely durable, but takes a long time to recharge\00Bee\00Evil Centipede\00Rice\00Antennae\00Enemies hit by your flower will get poisoned\00Wed\00Increases your maximum health and makes your flower toxic\00Basic\00Dec\00Web\00Feb\00%a %b %d %H:%M:%S %Y\00POSIX\00%H:%M:%S\00NAN\00PM\00AM\00LC_ALL\00LANG\00INF\00C\00???\000123456789\00C.UTF-8\0000000000-0000-4000-0000-000000000000\00Spooky.\00You must have done something really bad if she's chasing you.\00Someone overfed this one, you might be next.\00It stings. Don't touch it.\00Ants go in, and come out. Can't explain that.\00Avoid touching it, it hurts.\00Shiny, cute and mostly harmless.\00Cute and harmless.\00This one loves flowers.\00Weak and defenseless, but big dreams.\00These aren't quite as nice as the little bees.\00A bigger rock. It doesn't do much either.\00It's got wings and it's ready to use them.\00It's hungry and flowers are its favorite meal.\00A rock. It doesn't do much.\00It's just there doing its thing.\00This one is really big, but still cute.\00It's a bit temperamental, probably from working all the time.\00Cute an